abstract: >-
  Audited SQL, R, and Python source supporting the revised manuscript submitted
  to Frontiers in Cellular and Infection Microbiology (manuscript ID 1999181).
  No clinical data, completed imputations, patient-level profile assignments,
  or fitted model objects are distributed.
